                                      </picture>
                                      </a></p>
                                      <p>Worried about the cost of studying in New Zealand? There's funding available – and you might qualify. <a target="" href="https://www.aut.ac.nz/study/fees-and-scholarships/scholarships-and-awards-at-aut/international-scholarships" aria-label="Learn more about fees and scholarships">Learn more</a></p>
