                                        </a></p>
                                        <p>Facing financial challenges? We're here to help with essential support when you need it most. <a href="https://www.aut.ac.nz/student-life/support-services/student-hub/financial-support" aria-label="Learn more about financial support at AUT">Learn more</a></p>
