                                          </picture>
                                        </a></p>
                                        <p>From AI to public health, our research networks, institutes and centres work on problems that really matter. <a href="https://www.aut.ac.nz/research/research-networks-institutes-and-centres" aria-label="Learn more about research institutes and centres at AUT">Learn more</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div> 
                </li>
                
