    <div class="angled-bottom-right colorTitle"><div class="panelTitle">Key features</div></div>
    <div class="colorContent">
    <ul><li>Use the power of computing to solve complex problems</li><li>Focuses on developing innovative solutions</li><li>Opens up careers that are in high demand around the world</li><li>Includes a major research project for an industry organisation</li><li>Option to include subjects from across AUT in your degree</li></ul>
    </div>
</div>
